#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: _pages/issues.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Issues"
msgstr "问题报告"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/issues.md
msgid "If you come across an issue regarding F-Droid, please report it to the related issue tracker."
msgstr "如果你遇到有关 F-Droid 的问题，请将其报告给相关的问题跟踪器。"

#. type: Title ###
#: _pages/issues.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Client App"
msgstr "客户端应用"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/issues.md
msgid "If you’re having a problem with the F-Droid client application (our app store app), please check if we already know about it, and/or report it in [this issue tracker](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidclient/issues)."
msgstr "如果你在使用 F-Droid 客户端程序（我们的应用商店）时遇到问题，请检查我们是否已经知道它，并/或者在 [这个问题跟踪器](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidclient/issues) 报告它。"

#. type: Title ###
#: _pages/issues.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "App Data"
msgstr "应用数据"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/issues.md
msgid "For problems related to the contents of the F-Droid repository (the apps in our app store), such as a disappeared or outdated applications, please use [this issue tracker](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroiddata/issues)."
msgstr "与 F-Droid 存储库（我们应用商店中的应用）内容相关的问题，例如消失或过时的应用，请使用[此问题跟踪器](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroiddata/issues)。"

#. type: Title ###
#: _pages/issues.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Request for Packaging"
msgstr "请求打包"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/issues.md
msgid "To request a new application to be packaged (add an app to our app store), please, first check the app data issue tracker to see if that application was available in the past and got removed. Any remaining request for packaging (RFP) can be added to [this issue tracker](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/rfp/-/issues/)."
msgstr "要请求打包新应用（将应用添加到我们的应用商店），请首先检查应用数据问题跟踪器，看看该应用过去是否可用并被删除。 任何剩余的打包请求 (RFP) 都可以添加到 [此问题跟踪器](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/rfp/-/issues/)。"

#. type: Title ###
#: _pages/issues.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Server Tools"
msgstr "服务器工具"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/issues.md
msgid "For issues on the server tools (building apps yourself or running your own repo), please use [this issue tracker](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidserver/issues)."
msgstr "服务器工具的问题（自己构建应用或运行自己的存储库），请使用[这个问题跟踪器](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidserver/issues)。"

#. type: Title ###
#: _pages/issues.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Website"
msgstr "网站"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/issues.md
msgid "For issues relating to this web site, you can use [this issue tracker](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroid-website/issues)."
msgstr "网站相关问题，你可以使用 [这个问题跟踪器](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroid-website/issues)。"

#. type: Title ###
#: _pages/issues.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Website Search"
msgstr "网站搜索"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/issues.md
msgid "For issues relating to https://search.f-droid.org or search results in this website, you can use [this issue tracker](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroid-website-search/issues)."
msgstr "有关 https://search.f-droid.org 或者该网站搜索的问题，你可以使用[这个问题跟踪器](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroid-website-search/issues)。"

#. type: Title ###
#: _pages/issues.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Fire Hose"
msgstr "橡皮管"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/issues.md
msgid "If you have not found the right place, try searching through [all of the issues](https://gitlab.com/groups/fdroid/-/issues/)  tracked by the F-Droid project."
msgstr "如果你还没找到正确的地方，尝试搜索[所有 issues](https://gitlab.com/groups/fdroid/-/issues/), 它们被 F-Droid 项目所追踪。"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: _pages/repomaker.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Repomaker"
msgstr "Repomaker"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/repomaker.md
msgid "F-Droid.org is just a repo out of hundreds of repos created by individuals all around the globe. With the tools of F-Droid, everyone can create their own repo. So whether you are a musician who wants to publish their music or a developer who wants to serve nightly builds of their app, you are free to create your own repo and share it with other people independently of F-Droid.org."
msgstr "F-Droid.org 是全球各地独立个体所建立之数百个存储库中的一个。借助 F-Droid 的工具，每个人都可以创建自己的存储库。因此，无论你是想发布自己的音乐的音乐家，还是想为应用提供每日构建服务的开发人员，你都可以自由地创建自己的存储库，并独立于 F-Droid.org 与他人共享。"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/repomaker.md
msgid "In the past, creating a repo has been difficult because you had to have knowledge on the command line, needed to edit text files to edit your packages' store details and had to paste screenshots in a special system of directories to have them served well inside the F-Droid app."
msgstr "过去，建立一个存储库是很困难的，因为你必须掌握命令行操作，还得手动编辑文本文件来编辑包商店的详细信息，并且必须将屏幕截图放在一个特殊的目录系统中，才能让它们在 F-Droid 应用中使用。"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/repomaker.md
msgid "This all got easier now: with Repomaker, you are able to create your own repo and do not need to have any special knowledge to do so.  Check out the [installation guide](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/repomaker/blob/master/README.md#installation)  for information on how you can install Repomaker on your device."
msgstr "现在这一切都变得简单了：有了Repomaker，你就可以创建自己的存储库了，而且不需要任何专门的知识。查看[安装指南](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/repomaker/blob/master/README.md#installation)以了解如何在你的设备上安装 Repomaker。"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/repomaker.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[![]({% asset repomaker-screenshots/repo-details.png %})]({% asset repomaker-screenshots/repo-details.png %})<br/>\n"
"*Your repo can serve all types of media*\n"
msgstr ""
"[![]({% asset repomaker-screenshots/repo-details.png %})]({% asset repomaker-screenshots/repo-details.png %})<br/>\n"
"*你的存储库可以服务于各种类型的媒体*\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/repomaker.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[![]({% asset repomaker-screenshots/package-details.png %})]({% asset repomaker-screenshots/package-details.png %})<br/>\n"
"*Editing your package store details never was easier*\n"
msgstr ""
"[![]({% asset repomaker-screenshots/package-details.png %})]({% asset repomaker-screenshots/package-details.png %})<br/>\n"
"*编辑你的安装包商店详细信息从未如此简单*\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/repomaker.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[![]({% asset repomaker-screenshots/create-repo.png %})]({% asset repomaker-screenshots/create-repo.png %})<br/>\n"
"*Creating a repo just takes you two clicks*\n"
msgstr ""
"[![]({% asset repomaker-screenshots/create-repo.png %})]({% asset repomaker-screenshots/create-repo.png %})<br/>\n"
"*创建存储库只需要两次点击*\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/repomaker.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[![]({% asset repomaker-screenshots/add-storage.png %})]({% asset repomaker-screenshots/add-storage.png %})<br/>\n"
"*You have many possibilities where to upload your repo*\n"
msgstr ""
"[![]({% asset repomaker-screenshots/add-storage.png %})]({% asset repomaker-screenshots/add-storage.png %})<br/>\n"
"*你可以将你的存储库上传到各种地方*\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/repomaker.md
msgid "Like any other project of F-Droid, Repomaker is free and open source software. You can find the source code and its license on [gitlab.com](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/repomaker)."
msgstr "像 F-Droid 的其他项目一样，Repomaker 是自由开源软件。你可以在 [GitLab.com](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/repomaker) 上找到源代码及其许可。"

#~ msgid "The project is developed and maintained by community contributors. Volunteers form a core part of F-Droid.  You can help too:"
#~ msgstr "该项目由社区贡献者开发和维护。志愿者形成 F-Droid 项目的核心部分。   你也可以帮忙："

#, no-wrap
#~ msgid "Help Others"
#~ msgstr "帮助他人"

#~ msgid "If you already know something about F-Droid, then you can help others learn and get started.  Help answer questions that users and developers have about F-Droid! Please be considerate of our [code of conduct]({{ site.baseurl }}/docs/Code_of_Conduct).  We want to provide a positive and enjoyable environment for everybody."
#~ msgstr "如果你对 F-Droid 已有一定了解，你可以帮助其他人学习并开始使用 F-Droid。  帮助回答用户和开发者有关 F-Droid 的问题！请遵守我们的[行为准则]({{ site.baseurl }}/docs/Code_of_Conduct)。  我们希望为所有人提供积极和令人愉悦的环境。"

#, no-wrap
#~ msgid "Report Problems"
#~ msgstr "报告问题"

#~ msgid "If you experience problems with the site or client software, you can report them in [the appropriate issue tracker]({{ \"/issues/\" | prepend: site.baseurl }}), talk with us in the [Forums](https://forum.f-droid.org/) or join [the chat]({{ site.baseurl }}/about/#contact)  via your protocol of choice.  We also welcome help managing our issue trackers, including asking follow-up questions, reviewing merge requests, adding labels, and more."
#~ msgstr "如果遇到网站或客户端软件相关的问题，你可以在 [合适的问题跟踪器]({{ \"/issues/\" | prepend: site.baseurl }}) 中报告问题, 在 [论坛](https://forum.f-droid.org/) 中与我们交流或通过你选择的协议加入 [聊天]({{ site.baseurl }}/about/#contact)  。  我们也欢迎帮忙管理问题跟踪器，包括询问后续问题，审阅合并请求，添加标签等。"

#, no-wrap
#~ msgid "Submit Applications"
#~ msgstr "提交应用"

#~ msgid "If you see an application missing from the repository (after reading the [inclusion policy](../docs/Inclusion_Policy)), please feel free to submit it via the dedicated [Requests For Packaging](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/rfp/issues)  issue tracker."
#~ msgstr "如果发现存储库中未收录某个应用（请首先阅读[收录政策](../docs/Inclusion_Policy)），可随时通过专用的[打包请求](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/rfp/issues) 问题跟踪器提交。"

#~ msgid "The same applies for helping to build newer versions of applications."
#~ msgstr "这同样适用于帮助构建新版本的应用。"

#~ msgid "Further information can be found in [the documentation](../docs), or by asking in [the chat]({{ site.baseurl }}/about/#contact)."
#~ msgstr "更深入的信息可以在 [文档](../docs) 中获取，或者在[聊天]({{ site.baseurl }}/about/#contact)中提问。"

#~ msgid "The client application is available in many languages. Should yours not be among those, or be in need of updates or improvement, please create an account and use the [translation system](https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/f-droid/) to make your changes."
#~ msgstr "客户端应用提供多种语言。如果未提供你所用的语言，或需要更新或改善，请在[翻译平台](https://hosted.weblate.org/projects/f-droid/)上建立账号并进行更改。"

#~ msgid "Start with the overview of [Translation and Localization](../docs/Translation_and_Localization). There’s also a [dedicated forum section](https://forum.f-droid.org/c/translation) for translation related discussions."
#~ msgstr "请首先查看[翻译和本地化](../docs/Translation_and_Localization)概述。另外，关于翻译的讨论可访问[论坛专用版块](https://forum.f-droid.org/c/translation)。"

#, no-wrap
#~ msgid "Test"
#~ msgstr "测试"

#~ msgid "Testing upcoming F-Droid releases is the best way to make sure that a new release can do what you need it to do. And of course, if you report a problem to us, then we know about it and can fix it! If you have a bug to report, see the [issues page]({{ site.baseurl }}/issues/). One easy places to jump in is reviewing translation updates on <https://staging.f-droid.org/>."
#~ msgstr "测试即将发布的 F-Droid 版本是确保新版本能够做你需要它做的事的最佳方式。当然，如果你能给我们报告问题，我们就能知晓并修复它！如果你有 Bug 要报告，请见[问题页面]({{ site.baseurl }}/issues/)。审阅<https://staging.f-droid.org/>上的翻译更新是入门的好去处。"

